  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Sector Cooperation on green transition of energy sector in Ethiopia phase 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Strategic Sector Cooperation on energy in Ethiopia aims at improving the framework conditions of the Ethiopian Energy sector in general and improving the long-term renewable energy planning at national hold. The cooperation is expected to contribute to the following outcomes:
 
&#x2022;	Improved national planning of energy consumption and supply   
&#x2022;	Increased cross-sectoral planning of energy consumption and supply 
&#x2022;	Improvement of national regulatory frameworks for energy management
&#x2022;	Advisory support (platform) to stakeholders and mandated bodies on management of energy</narrative>
  </description>
