  <result type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancement of the institutional setup and development of a self-driven and supportive environment for decision making based on long-term planning and modelling</narrative>
   </title>
   <reference code="270937" vocabulary="99"></reference>
   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="1" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creation of an institutional platform for planning</narrative>
    </title>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="Facilitate modelling team&#x2019;s work, including quarterly meetings to facilitate discussions and strengthen the platform.

(Continue cooperation is a precondition for the 2022 target)"></target>
     <actual value="Activities restarted partly during spring 2022. The training activities succeeded in building capacity to a higher level and laid down the tracks for further capacity building to evolve in 2023.

Key results:
-	The Ethiopian Energy Outlook was published in October 2022
-	Support to Ethiopian Electric Power in updating their 10 years master plan with both virtual and physical training"></actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="Maintaining an institutional platfor for planning"></target>
     <actual value="Creation of an energy modelling team across both MoWE and EEP has been completed. The facilitation of the energy modelling team&#x2019;s work is ongoing and incomplete due to conflict and pause in cooperation between DEA and Ethiopian partners"></actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="Creation of an institutional platform for planning"></target>
     <actual value="Preliminary screening of institutional setup and assessment of the potential for transfer of knowledge and capacity building completed"></actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2023-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2023-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="Completed in 2022"></target>
     <actual></actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
